⦃ ⟗ ○△ ᚳ ⧖ ○△ ⧗⁰ △ ⊞ ᚡᚧ ⦄ ⟨ ⟦ ℤ ⟧ ⊸ ◌ ⟦ ℤ ⟧ ⟩ ᚡᚩ ⸫

⍝ ᚡᚪ path line col: "path:line:col: error: " (for a plane cell, its file and coordinates, A.1.2)
⦄
  ⧖ ⧖ ⧖
