==== s2 code generation (spec §13): stack-to-SSA and LLVM IR, line for line as s1's emit.uh ⍝
⍝ Runs on the heap the check pass leaves. Registers: 26 next %t, 27 next L,
28 the IR lines (a queue of strings), 29 the globals, 30 the current label, ⍝
⍝ 31 the future-call frames (a stack of [below calls]), 32 the failure return
(−1: none), 33 next string constant, 34 debug, 35 hoisted post-selections, ⍝
⍝ 36 functions (a queue of [name sym ffi f node ops0 ops1]), 41 … 48 the texts
"i8" "i64" "double" "ptr" "i1" "true" "false" "0". ⍝
⍝ An entry of the virtual stack is [ty v ok role hasc c lit slots live neg cmp]:
v and ok are SSA texts (−1: none), c a known value when hasc is 1, slots, ⍝
⍝ live and neg the lists of a superposition, cmp the [eq gt lt a b] of a fresh ≶.

⍝ ---- IR text

⍝ ᚡᚧᛇ C s: a line as it is
